    {
      "name": "get_workspace_context",
      "description": "Retrieve the bounded orientation projection for continuing work: goal, proposed and accepted decisions, open tasks, findings, artifacts, recent provenance, authorization-aware needsYou (work you can act on) and needsAttention (other team records — attention ordering, not an access boundary), current work, and an orientation hint. Each slice carries total, returned, and truncated; attentionCoverage states the returned task and decision page counts and whether the attention lists are complete under their selection rules (a truncated source page can hide a matching cue). needsAttention also carries a team review cue with reason accepted_decision_needs_review for a returned accepted decision whose cited findings are no longer current — a review cue, not a revocation of acceptance and not a transition. Pass orientationCursor to get_workspace_changes to catch up. Pass `since` (a contribution id) to also receive contributions strictly after it.",
